			"notes": "## Fabric builds for legacy versions (previously Forge-only)\n\n* **1.0.1** — 1.16.5 Fabric (old API id `fabric`)\n* **1.1.1** — 1.17.1 Fabric (old API id `fabric`)\n* **1.2.1** — 1.18.2 Fabric\n* **1.3.1** — 1.19.2 Fabric\n* **1.4.0** — 1.19.4 Fabric + Forge\n\nRecipes unchanged: coal/charcoal × furnace/blast furnace → 1 gunpowder.\nVerified on real dedicated servers: **Fabric 1.16.5 and Fabric 1.19.4**.\n\nLegacy Fabric API: 1.16.5/1.17.1 use the old mod id `fabric`; 1.18.2+ use `fabric-api`.\n\n对应源码：仓库 `1.16.5/` – `1.19.4/` 各版本目录。"
